\newlabel{tab:divergence}{{9}{38}{$83\%$ of the standard target's tokens are identical between any two drugs in the same context. The residual row is quoted at cell-line scope; at plate scope it reads $120.3$ and $0.7467$. The retrieval ceiling is unchanged across all three rows: the information was always present, and the tokenisation discarded it}{table.caption.20}{}}
