\newlabel{tab:allarms}{{17}{57}{Every arm on the calibrated metric, by frame. Chance is $0.50$ in both. The residual-frame figures are the rebuilt-target run of \S \ref {sec:res-generalisation} and \S \ref {sec:res-lookup}; the held-out subset carries the outcome-selection caveat stated there}{table.caption.30}{}}
